# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what belongs in this public repo.
# Parent directories must be un-ignored before their files can be tracked.

*
!*/

# --- Root entrypoints / docs ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Guide.html
!generate_slot.bat
!merge_slots.bat

# --- Tools (sources, frozen exes, licenses, cooked templates) ---
!Tools/
!Tools/**

# --- MergeInbox: keep instructions only (never user packs) ---
!MergeInbox/
!MergeInbox/README.md

# --- Hard deny (even under allowed trees) ---
out/
dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
*.zip
*.pak
.env
.env.*
*.log
MergeInbox/**
!MergeInbox/README.md
Tools/templates/**/_*
Tools/_pyi_build/
